              "value": {
                "html": "<p>По­сле­до­ва­тель­но по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\angle ACB=\\angle ACH-\\angle BCH=(90^{\\circ}-\\angle A)-\\angle BCH=90^{\\circ}-30^{\\circ}-22^{\\circ}=38^{\\circ}\"></span>.</span></p></center>",
