              "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"a1ea1011-33a4-40e6-9512-dcd0909c8cb4\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/a1ea1011-33a4-40e6-9512-dcd0909c8cb4\"/>В тре­уголь­ни­ке <var data-math-identifier=\"ABC\">ABC</var> угол <var data-math-identifier=\"A\">A</var> равен <span data-inline-latex=\"84^{\\circ}\"></span>, <var data-math-identifier=\"CH\">CH</var>  — вы­со­та, угол <var data-math-identifier=\"BCH\">BCH</var> равен <span data-inline-latex=\"4^{\\circ}\"></span>. Най­ди­те угол <var data-math-identifier=\"ACB\">ACB</var>. Ответ дайте в гра­ду­сах.</p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": [
                "image_1"
              ],
              "section_id": "condition:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<p>По­сле­до­ва­тель­но по­лу­ча­ем:</p><center><p><span> <span data-inline-latex=\"\\angle ACB=\\angle ACH-\\angle BCH=(90^{\\circ}-\\angle A)-\\angle BCH=90^{\\circ}-84^{\\circ}-4^{\\circ}=2^{\\circ}\"></span>.</span></p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
